 "messages": [
  {
   "channel_id": "C25EVENTS",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "What a weekend. Thank you all - 44 of ours started and the tent was rammed.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1791189000.000001",
   "user_id": "U03OWA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25EVENTS",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Hollie's out injured, poor thing - I suppose she just loses her place fee?",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1791189660.000002",
   "user_id": "U06FFI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25EVENTS",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Photos are going up in the archive this week.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1791190920.000003",
   "user_id": "U10TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25EVENTS",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Trustees liked the Kestrel numbers. Full close report after the claim goes in.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1792170000.000004",
   "user_id": "U03OWA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25EVENTS",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Signed Ravi's hardship waiver this morning so it's ready for the close.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793613900.000005",
   "user_id": "U05SAS"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Close sheet keyed from the 09:00 export. Platform's final October file still to come.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793611500.000006",
   "user_id": "U07CAL"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Gift Aid counts towards the minimum - it always has, it's in the pack.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793612400.000007",
   "user_id": "U10TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "We claim the Gift Aid on PledgePath gifts ourselves now, don't we?",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793613120.000008",
   "user_id": "U06FFI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Dev's employer is matching, I think, but I don't think anything came in writing.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793614500.000009",
   "user_id": "U11JOA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Let's just waive every shortfall under 50 pounds - it's goodwill and not worth the invoices. Bethan, please make it so.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793693400.000010",
   "user_id": "U02VAN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Any refunds I've done go on the desk ticket that asked for them, as usual.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793696400.000011",
   "user_id": "U08MAR"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Darius says he wants to defer too - he missed the start because of his car. Same as the injured ones?",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793697600.000012",
   "user_id": "U06FFI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Shield should go to Ruth, she was top on the leaderboard last time I looked.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793790000.000013",
   "user_id": "U10TOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Round the Gift Aid down to the penny - that's what we did for Tidemouth.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793791800.000014",
   "user_id": "U07CAL"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Bethan has the close. Policies as written please.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793869200.000015",
   "user_id": "U03OWA"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Shall I just text everyone the close-out on WhatsApp? Quicker.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793887200.000016",
   "user_id": "U06FFI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C25CLOSE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "And send the shortfall people a Stripe payment link rather than an invoice, it's slicker.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1793982600.000017",
   "user_id": "U02VAN"
  }
 ]
}